(7716783, 1268950, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the sheer, matter-of-factedness of this image that appeals to me immensely. If I had a "Dark Horse" award, I''d give it to this one. Maybe I should create a "Dark Horse" award?</td>', 'There''s something about the sheer, matter-of-factedness of this image that appeals to me immensely. If I had a "Dark Horse" award, I''d give it to this one. Maybe I should create a "Dark Horse" award?', '2022-03-15 19:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
