(7717193, 1268957, 173844, '<td valign="top">Inside a snow globe, enchanted.  The falling snow can bring on the feeling of quiet timelessness, as conveyed here.  Black and white, all the better.  Could be anywhere, but NYC is a guess.  Beautifully captures the mood.</td>', 'Inside a snow globe, enchanted.  The falling snow can bring on the feeling of quiet timelessness, as conveyed here.  Black and white, all the better.  Could be anywhere, but NYC is a guess.  Beautifully captures the mood.', '2022-03-20 23:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
